\q1 \v 17 Your sons hurry;
\q2 the ones having torn you down and the ones having desolated you will go out from you.
\q1 \v 18 Lift up your eyes around and see all of them;
\q2 they are gathered, they have come to you.
\q1 “The life of me”—the declaration of Yahweh—
\q2 “that you do {not} wear all of them like jewelry
